ed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestone/51","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51/labels","id":3850624,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzg1MDYyNA==","number":51,"title":"1.4","description":null,"creator":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":263,"state":"closed","created_at":"2018-11-27T04:11:27Z","updated_at":"2023-03-07T15:41:37Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-03-18T12:29:03Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2020-11-16T08:12:23Z","updated_at":"2020-11-16T16:17:42Z","closed_at":"2020-11-16T16:17:42Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nUnder certain conditions in SQLAlchemy 1.4 beta1, a query for an `orm.Bundle` can behave as if `single_entity=True`, even though this flag is actually off. From my testing, it seems that the required conditions are that all of the columns/expressions in the `Bundle` are labelled.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nSince the Bundle has `single_entity=False`, a query for the bundle alone should return an iterable of singleton tuples of tuples; but it actually just returns an iterable of tuples. See the failed assertion below for an example.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nI've written a test [here](https://github.com/acarapetis/sqlalchemy/commit/7a7c204bb058e1fcb5dacd5af8c830bab2b12ff4) which demonstrates the issue: it passes on 1.3.20 and fails on 1.4.0b1.\r\n\r\n```py\r\n    def test_labelled_cols(self):\r\n        Data = self.classes.Data\r\n        sess = Session()\r\n\r\n        b1 = Bundle(\"b1\", Data.d1.label('x'), Data.d2.label('y'))\r\n\r\n        eq_(\r\n            sess.query(b1).filter(b1.c.x.between(\"d3d1\", \"d5d1\")).all(),\r\n            [((\"d3d1\", \"d3d2\"),), ((\"d4d1\", \"d4d2\"),), ((\"d5d1\", \"d5d2\"),)],\r\n        )\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Error**\r\n\r\n```\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/anthony/sqlalchemy/test/orm/test_bundle.py\", line 177, in test_labelled_cols\r\n    eq_(\r\n  File \"/home/anthony/sqlalchemy/test/../lib/sqlalchemy/testing/assertions.py\", line 210, in eq_\r\n    assert a == b, msg or \"%r != %r\" % (a, b)\r\nAssertionError: [('d3d1', 'd3d2'), ('d4d1', 'd4d2'), ('d5d1', 'd5d2')] != [(('d3d1', 'd3d2'),), (('d4d1', 'd4d2'),), (('d5d1', 'd5d2'),)]\r\nassert [('d3d1', 'd3...5d1', 'd5d2')] == [(('d3d1', 'd...1', 'd5d2'),)]\r\n  At index 0 diff: ('d3d1', 'd3d2') != (('d3d1', 'd3d2'),)\r\n  Full diff:\r\n  - [(('d3d1', 'd3d2'),), (('d4d1', 'd4d2'),), (('d5d1', 'd5d2'),)]\r\n  ?  -                 ^^^^                 ^^^^                --\r\n  + [('d3d1', 'd3d2'), ('d4d1', 'd4d2'), ('d5d1', 'd5d2')]\r\n  ?                   ^                 ^\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Ubuntu 20.04.1 LTS\r\n - Python: 3.8.5\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.4.0b1\r\n - Database: Postgresql 12, MariaDB 10.3\r\n - DBAPI: psycopg2, pymysql\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5702/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}